      "value": "I'd like a clear stance on NSFW content with ways to make sure it can't be accessed by minors if allowed.\n\nI don't care if it's allowed or banned, I just wanna know what creators can do for sure, without rules changing every few months or only being enforced for some people (yes I'm thinking about Twitch).",
